  "_comment": "Record types and their merge policy. Normative for server and clients (docs/protocol.md §5). 'text' fields merge line by line, 'sets' as sets, 'opaque' fields (e.g. RTF) never merge: changed on both sides = conflict. Unknown types are stored with policy 'lww'.",
